{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack devtools provides you with an easy to use and modular client that allows you to compose multiple devtools into one easy to use panel."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"setup","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Setup"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Install the "},{"type":"link","href":"https://www.npmjs.com/package/@tanstack/react-devtools","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack Devtools"}]},{"type":"text","value":" library, this will install the devtools core as well as provide you framework specific adapters."}]},{"type":"code","value":"npm i @tanstack/react-devtools","lang":"bash"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Next in the root of your application import the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TanStackDevtools"},{"type":"text","value":" from the required framework adapter (in this case @tanstack/react-devtools)."}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { TanStackDevtools } from '@tanstack/react-devtools'\n\nimport App from './App'\n\ncreateRoot(document.getElementById('root')!).render(\n  <StrictMode>\n    <App />\n\n    <TanStackDevtools />\n  </StrictMode>,\n)","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Import the desired devtools and provide it to the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TanStackDevtools"},{"type":"text","value":" component along with a label for the menu."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Currently TanStack offers:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueryDevtools"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"RouterDevtools"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"PacerDevtools"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"FormDevtools"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/form/pull/1692","children":[{"type":"text","value":"coming soon"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { createRoot } from 'react-dom/client'\n\nimport { TanStackDevtools } from '@tanstack/react-devtools'\n\nimport { ReactQueryDevtoolsPanel } from '@tanstack/react-query-devtools'\nimport { TanStackRouterDevtoolsPanel } from '@tanstack/react-router-devtools'\nimport { ReactFormDevtoolsPanel } from '@tanstack/react-form-devtools'\n\n\nimport App from './App'\n\ncreateRoot(document.getElementById('root')!).render(\n  <StrictMode>\n    <App />\n\n    <TanStackDevtools\n      plugins={[\n        {\n          name: 'TanStack Query',\n          render: <ReactQueryDevtoolsPanel />,\n        },\n        {\n          name: 'TanStack Router',\n          render: <TanStackRouterDevtoolsPanel />,\n        },\n        {\n          name: 'TanStack Form',\n          render: <ReactFormDevtoolsPanel />,\n        },\n      ]}\n    />\n  </StrictMode>,\n)","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Finally add any additional configuration you desire to the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TanStackDevtools"},{"type":"text","value":" component, more information can be found under the "},{"type":"link","href":"../../configuration","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack Devtools Configuration"}]},{"type":"text","value":" section."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A complete working example can be found in our "},{"type":"link","href":"https://tanstack.com/devtools/latest/docs/framework/react/examples/basic","children":[{"type":"text","value":"basic example"}]},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"setup","text":"Setup","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nTanStack devtools provides you with an easy to use and modular client that allows you to compose multiple devtools into one easy to use panel.\n\n## Setup\n\nInstall the [TanStack Devtools](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@tanstack/react-devtools) library, this will install the devtools core as well as provide you framework specific adapters.\n\n```bash\nnpm i @tanstack/react-devtools\n```\n\nNext in the root of your application import the `TanStackDevtools` from the required framework adapter (in this case @tanstack/react-devtools).\n\n```tsx\nimport { TanStackDevtools } from '@tanstack/react-devtools'\n\nimport App from './App'\n\ncreateRoot(document.getElementById('root')!).render(\n  <StrictMode>\n    <App />\n\n    <TanStackDevtools />\n  </StrictMode>,\n)\n```\n\nImport the desired devtools and provide it to the `TanStackDevtools` component along with a label for the menu.\n\nCurrently TanStack offers:\n\n- `QueryDevtools`\n- `RouterDevtools`\n- `PacerDevtools`\n- `FormDevtools` [coming soon](https://github.com/TanStack/form/pull/1692)\n\n```tsx\nimport { createRoot } from 'react-dom/client'\n\nimport { TanStackDevtools } from '@tanstack/react-devtools'\n\nimport { ReactQueryDevtoolsPanel } from '@tanstack/react-query-devtools'\nimport { TanStackRouterDevtoolsPanel } from '@tanstack/react-router-devtools'\nimport { ReactFormDevtoolsPanel } from '@tanstack/react-form-devtools'\n\n\nimport App from './App'\n\ncreateRoot(document.getElementById('root')!).render(\n  <StrictMode>\n    <App />\n\n    <TanStackDevtools\n      plugins={[\n        {\n          name: 'TanStack Query',\n          render: <ReactQueryDevtoolsPanel />,\n        },\n        {\n          name: 'TanStack Router',\n          render: <TanStackRouterDevtoolsPanel />,\n        },\n        {\n          name: 'TanStack Form',\n          render: <ReactFormDevtoolsPanel />,\n        },\n      ]}\n    />\n  </StrictMode>,\n)\n```\n\nFinally add any additional configuration you desire to the `TanStackDevtools` component, more information can be found under the [TanStack Devtools Configuration](../../configuration) section.\n\nA complete working example can be found in our [basic example](https://tanstack.com/devtools/latest/docs/framework/react/examples/basic).\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\ntitle: Basic setup\nid: basic-setup\n---\n\nTanStack devtools provides you with an easy to use and modular client that allows you to compose multiple devtools into one easy to use panel.\n\n## Setup\n\nInstall the [TanStack Devtools](https://www.npmjs.com/package/@tanstack/react-devtools) library, this will install the devtools core as well as provide you framework specific adapters.\n\n```bash\nnpm i @tanstack/react-devtools\n```\n\nNext in the root of your application import the `TanStackDevtools` from the required framework adapter (in this case @tanstack/react-devtools).\n\n```tsx\nimport { TanStackDevtools } from '@tanstack/react-devtools'\n\nimport App from './App'\n\ncreateRoot(document.getElementById('root')!).render(\n  <StrictMode>\n    <App />\n\n    <TanStackDevtools />\n  </StrictMode>,\n)\n```\n\nImport the desired devtools and provide it to the `TanStackDevtools` component along with a label for the menu.\n\nCurrently TanStack offers:\n\n- `QueryDevtools`\n- `RouterDevtools`\n- `PacerDevtools`\n- `FormDevtools` [coming soon](https://github.com/TanStack/form/pull/1692)\n\n```tsx\nimport { createRoot } from 'react-dom/client'\n\nimport { TanStackDevtools } from '@tanstack/react-devtools'\n\nimport { ReactQueryDevtoolsPanel } from '@tanstack/react-query-devtools'\nimport { TanStackRouterDevtoolsPanel } from '@tanstack/react-router-devtools'\nimport { ReactFormDevtoolsPanel } from '@tanstack/react-form-devtools'\n\n\nimport App from './App'\n\ncreateRoot(document.getElementById('root')!).render(\n  <StrictMode>\n    <App />\n\n    <TanStackDevtools\n      plugins={[\n        {\n          name: 'TanStack Query',\n          render: <ReactQueryDevtoolsPanel />,\n        },\n        {\n          name: 'TanStack Router',\n          render: <TanStackRouterDevtoolsPanel />,\n        },\n        {\n          name: 'TanStack Form',\n          render: <ReactFormDevtoolsPanel />,\n        },\n      ]}\n    />\n  </StrictMode>,\n)\n```\n\nFinally add any additional configuration you desire to the `TanStackDevtools` component, more information can be found under the [TanStack Devtools Configuration](../../configuration) section.\n\nA complete working example can be found in our [basic example](https://tanstack.com/devtools/latest/docs/framework/react/examples/basic).\n"}
